Master Prompt: SEO Site Architecture, Keyword Clustering, Topical Authority & Internal Linking
Reusable template — replace the input placeholders and attach relevant GSC CSV exports before running the prompt.
ROLE
Act as a senior SEO strategist, keyword clustering specialist, topical authority planner, technical SEO consultant, information architect, and website content strategist.
Analyse my primary keyword, supporting keywords, and competitor URLs. Create an SEO-first website structure that satisfies search intent, covers the topic usefully, builds topical authority, and connects pages through logical internal linking.
Do not assume every keyword needs a separate page. First research and cluster keywords, then recommend the right pages and URL structure. Do not build the website or write full articles until I approve the plan.
