Homepage purpose and targeting.
URL structure, hierarchy, categories, and supporting pages.
Keyword themes covered by important pages.
Internal linking between hubs and supporting pages.
Content usefulness, depth, examples, and topical coverage.
Tools, calculators, converters, or interactive features.
