Rules:
Inspect actual pages where possible. Never invent competitor URLs, traffic, keyword difficulty, backlinks, rankings, or schema findings.
Clearly label inaccessible information and inferences.
Use metrics only when reliable data is available from connected tools or supplied sources.
Separate observed facts from recommendations.
Do not copy competitor content or blindly copy their architecture.
